--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
PATH RECONCILIATION (no silent drift — covenant #9)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The prompt template names the native output `apps/apple/TeslaSync/dashboard-widgets/`.
This repo's Apple app is an XcodeGen project (apps/apple/project.yml) whose ONLY
compiled app-source root is `apps/apple/Sources/` (shared by the iOS + macOS app
targets). A file under `TeslaSync/dashboard-widgets/` would NOT be compiled into
any target — i.e. it would be dead code, violating the no-stub covenant.

The surface was therefore placed at the real, compiled locations, decomposed per
the "decomposition preferred over monoliths" guideline (each file < 400 lines to
satisfy SwiftLint file_length under --strict):
  apps/apple/Sources/Dashboard/Widgets/FleetStatsWidget.swift            (views)
  apps/apple/Sources/Dashboard/Widgets/FleetStatsWidgetModel.swift       (binding + model + diagnostics)
  apps/apple/Sources/Dashboard/Widgets/FleetStatsWidgetProjection.swift  (i18n + registry + adapter + state)
  apps/apple/Tests/Unit/Dashboard/FleetStatsWidgetTests.swift            (tests)
XcodeGen picks these up automatically (verified: 24 refs in the generated
pbxproj across TeslaSync, TeslaSync-macOS, TeslaSyncTests, TeslaSync-macOSTests).

